              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khona uDaniyeli, ogama lakhe lalinguBeliteshasari, wamangala ihora elilodwa, nemicabango yakhe yamethusa. Inkosi yasikhuluma yathi: Belitshazari, iphupho kakungakhathazi. UBeliteshasari waphendula wathi: “Nkosi yami, iphupho lingelabakuzondayo, nencazelo yalo ngezitha zakho;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
