              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi inkosi yabona umlindi kanye nongcwele ehla evela ezulwini futhi yathi: Gawulani isihlahla futhi nisibhubhise; shiyani isiphunzi sezimpande zawo emhlabathini, ngebhande lensimbi nelethusi, otshanini obuthambileyo basendle; malimanziswe ngamazolo ezulu, libe phakathi kwezilwane zasendle, kudlule phezu kwalo izikhathi eziyisikhombisa;",
          "type": "text",
