          "text": "Ngakho-ke, nkosi, makwamukeleke iseluleko sami kuwe, wephule izono zakho ngokwahlulela nobubi bakho ngokuhawukela abampofu; uma kungase kube ukunwetshwa kokuthula kwakho.",
