          "text": "Ngasekugcineni kwezinsuku mina, Nebukadinesari, ngaphakamisela amehlo ami ezulwini, nokuqonda kwami kwabuyela kimi, ngambonga oPhezukonke, ngamdumisa, ngamdumisa yena ophila kuze kube phakade, ombuso wakhe ungumbuso ophakade, nokubusa kwakhe kungokwesizukulwane ngezizukulwane;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.34"
            ]
          }
        }
